WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.061
(footsteps)

00:00:01.061 --> 00:00:03.453
- Hey Justin, ready to go see San Andreas?

00:00:03.453 --> 00:00:07.156
- Oh man, I forgot I actually
made plans with Quinta

00:00:07.156 --> 00:00:08.340
to see San Andreas.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.374
She loves the Rock.

00:00:09.374 --> 00:00:10.775
- Uh yeah, that's cool.

00:00:10.775 --> 00:00:12.133
I mean we all love the Rock.

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.118
- Yeah, hey, but raincheck though?

00:00:14.118 --> 00:00:15.779
I'll watch it again with you.
- Okay.

00:00:15.779 --> 00:00:17.433
- [Justin] All right. (laughs)
- Can't wait.

00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:18.626
Have fun.

00:00:18.626 --> 00:00:22.828
(comical yet regal music)

00:00:22.828 --> 00:00:24.679
(squeaking)

00:00:26.611 --> 00:00:27.447
(pants)

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:29.803
- Hey Justin, ready to
go play some basketball?

00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:32.288
- Uh sorry man, I promised Quinta

00:00:32.288 --> 00:00:33.704
I'd play racketball with her.

00:00:33.704 --> 00:00:36.525
- Quinta, oh ok, cool.

00:00:36.525 --> 00:00:37.767
- You could come, if you want.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:39.891
- Nah, it's okay, you
know I don't like rackets.

00:00:39.891 --> 00:00:40.668
- Raincheck then?

00:00:40.668 --> 00:00:41.283
- [Voiceover] Yeah.

00:00:41.283 --> 00:00:41.817
- I'll see ya later.

00:00:41.817 --> 00:00:42.316
- Cool.

00:00:42.316 --> 00:00:44.056
I hope you have a bad ankle injury.

00:00:44.056 --> 00:00:44.764
- What was that?

00:00:44.764 --> 00:00:46.320
- I said have a great time.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.011
- All right, hey bye.

00:00:49.663 --> 00:00:50.836
- Hey yo, Chef Curry.

00:00:50.836 --> 00:00:52.498
You ready for Smoked Salmon Saturday?

00:00:52.498 --> 00:00:54.261
- I'm sorry, Zack, I'm actually doing

00:00:54.261 --> 00:00:56.316
Sirloin Souffle Saturdays with Quinta.

00:00:56.316 --> 00:01:00.137
- Sirloin Souffle, it's
like a meat in a pastry?

00:01:00.137 --> 00:01:01.157
- She's a great cook.

00:01:01.157 --> 00:01:02.376
- (chuckles sarcastically)
Sounds like it, cool.

00:01:02.376 --> 00:01:03.097
- Raincheck?

00:01:03.097 --> 00:01:03.944
- Yeah, let's raincheck.

00:01:03.944 --> 00:01:04.757
- All right. (laughing)

00:01:04.757 --> 00:01:05.882
- [Zack] Sounds good, see ya later.

00:01:05.882 --> 00:01:07.240
I hope you burn your meat.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.076
- Wait, what?

00:01:08.076 --> 00:01:11.599
- Uh, I hope you meet her family.

00:01:12.389 --> 00:01:14.478
- Cool man, see ya.

00:01:14.478 --> 00:01:17.217
- (sighs) Do, do do.

00:01:17.217 --> 00:01:19.191
All right, Justin, you ready for Hawaii?

00:01:19.191 --> 00:01:22.518
- Oh man, I'm sorry I completely forgot.

00:01:22.518 --> 00:01:24.582
I made plans to go to the
Caribbean with Quinta.

00:01:24.582 --> 00:01:26.439
- Justin we already have tickets.

00:01:26.439 --> 00:01:28.483
- I know, can you like sell
them on Craigslist or something?

00:01:28.483 --> 00:01:29.667
- I don't think that's how it works,

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.002
your name is on the ticket!

00:01:31.002 --> 00:01:33.440
- I, just, find another
Justin Tan, there are tons.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.937
- I don't want another Justin Tan.

00:01:35.937 --> 00:01:38.023
I want this Justin Tan.

00:01:38.023 --> 00:01:38.913
(sad music)

00:01:38.913 --> 00:01:41.111
- How about we hang out when I get back?

00:01:41.111 --> 00:01:42.362
All right?

00:01:42.362 --> 00:01:44.451
- You actually promise this time?

00:01:44.451 --> 00:01:45.635
- I promise.

00:01:45.635 --> 00:01:46.796
- Okay.

00:01:47.986 --> 00:01:49.390
- (sighs) I'll see ya later.

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:50.216
- 'Kay.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.230
I hope she gets bit by a shark.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:52.949
- Wait, what?

00:01:52.949 --> 00:01:56.260
- I said she's a lucky and lovely girl.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.534
- Thanks.

00:01:58.168 --> 00:01:59.535
All right.
- [Zack] But I hope

00:01:59.535 --> 00:02:00.415
she gets bit by a shark.

00:02:00.415 --> 00:02:05.198
(upbeat music)

00:02:05.198 --> 00:02:06.784
(squeaking)

